# Shortwave: an original lo-fi hip-hop beat. One small melody on a lead that sounds like a cheap
# radio, drifting in and out like a far-off station: it tunes in during the intro, slips into the
# second verse in fragments, and has the static break to itself. Straight, sparse drums.
title: Shortwave
composer: GLM, Claude & SZ
year: 2026
source: original
category: originals
style: lofi
key: C minor
tempo: 80
time: 4/4
about: A late-night beat that keeps tuning back to one small melody, drifting in and out of the static like a far-off station.

